{"unit_id":"ferrisching__dsh-prompt-predict#feature-3","repo":"ferrisching/dsh-prompt-predict","commit":"756b9ebe7ece35fc817c39200e620d9f24f9fe9b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-predict 的功能「重新生成候选」：用户可请求生成新建议，并在候选间切换；插件会限制切换次数并避免近似重复。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host-route.mjs:507-557","client/src/04-composer.js:632-743"]}
{"unit_id":"ferrisching__dsh-prompt-predict#feature-4","repo":"ferrisching/dsh-prompt-predict","commit":"756b9ebe7ece35fc817c39200e620d9f24f9fe9b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-predict 的功能「配置预测行为」：设置页允许启停预测、选择模型和建议语言，并调整上下文、输出长度、历史记录等参数；用户覆盖项保存在本机配置文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/src/05-settings.js:1","lib/config.mjs:8-28","lib/host-route.mjs:404-405"]}
